        <div class="sup-actions">
          <a class="sup-view" href="sourcing/zhongsen.html">VIEW SUPPLIER &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SOURCING CONNECT SUPPLIER CARD TEMPLATE
         (for future suppliers - copy one block per supplier into #supGrid,
          keep blocks sorted A-Z by company display name)

    <article class="sup-card" data-slug="company-slug" data-cats="Sports Facilities" data-apps="" data-search="brand name | legal company name | country | category | main products, keywords, applications | short capability line">
      <div class="sup-tile"><span class="sup-init">CS</span><span class="sup-tile-tag">SELECTED SUPPLIER</span></div>
      <div class="sup-body">
        <h3 class="sup-name"><a href="sourcing/company-slug.html">COMPANY NAME</a></h3>
        <p class="sup-country">&#127464;&#127475; China</p>
        <div class="sup-cats"><span>Sports Facilities</span></div>
        <ul class="sup-kws"><li>main product 1</li><li>main product 2</li><li>main product 3</li></ul>
        <div class="sup-actions">
          <a class="sup-view" href="sourcing/company-slug.html">VIEW SUPPLIER &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    Logo / main product image tile variant (replace the two <span> inside .sup-tile):
      <div class="sup-tile"><img src="images/sourcing/company-slug.png" alt="COMPANY NAME logo" style="max-height:86px;max-width:82%;object-fit:contain;position:relative;z-index:2;"></div>

    Rules:
      - NO Booth No. / NO Book a Meeting / NO "EXHIBITOR" tag (these suppliers do not exhibit on site)
      - .sup-tile-tag is always "SELECTED SUPPLIER"
      - VIEW SUPPLIER + card name link to /sourcing/company-slug.html
      - data-cats must use one of the 8 Sourcing Connect categories:
        Sports Facilities | Fitness Equipment | Sports Bags | Pickleball & Racket Sports | Sportswear | Sports Equipment | Outdoor & Water Sports
      - future detail pages will add a CONTACT THIS SUPPLIER form; list page stays as is
         ============================================================ -->
  </div>

  <!-- NO RESULTS -->
  <!-- EMPTY STATE: shown while the Sourcing Connect list is being confirmed (no cards yet, no filter active) -->
  <div class="no-results show" id="emptyState">
    <h3>Sourcing Connect suppliers are being confirmed.</h3>
    <p>The full list of selected sports suppliers will be published here soon.<br>In the meantime, tell us what you are sourcing and the PSS team will help you find relevant suppliers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="no-results" id="noResults">
    <h3>No suppliers found for this combination.</h3>
    <p>Try a different keyword or category &mdash; or submit a sourcing request and the PSS team will help you find relevant suppliers.</p>
    <button class="btn-primary" style="padding:13px 32px;font-size:0.9rem;" onclick="clearFilters()" type="button">CLEAR FILTERS</button>
  </div>

</main>

<!-- BUYER SOURCING CTA -->
<section id="sourcing-cta">
  <h2 class="section-title">CAN&rsquo;T FIND THE SUPPLIER YOU NEED?</h2>
  <p class="cta-desc">Tell us what products or sports solutions you are sourcing. The PSS team can help identify relevant suppliers and sourcing partners for your needs.</p>
  <div class="cta-btn-row">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="matchmaking/buyer-request.html">SUBMIT SOURCING REQUEST &rarr;</a>
    <a class="btn-outline" href="registration.html?type=buyer">REGISTER AS TRADE BUYER</a>
  </div>
  <p class="cta-mm">Buyer&ndash;Supplier Matchmaking Session: October 9, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 3:00&ndash;5:00 PM</p>
</section>

